<title>ITALY: Italy unemployment conference delayed again.</title>
<headline>Italy unemployment conference delayed again.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A national conference on unemployment has been postponed for the second time and is now due to be held in January, Labour Minister Tiziano Treu said on Friday.</p>
<p>The conference was originally due to take place in Naples in September but was postponed until November 21-22 because unions and employeers were still holding talks on new contracts.</p>
<p>Treu told reporters it would be better to wait until after the passage in parliament of the 1997 budget.</p>
<p>The cost-cutting budget must be passed by the end of the year.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom 39-6-6782505</p>
</text>
